Example:

##Scenario

AI recommends:

chmod -R 777 /var/www

to fix an Apache permission issue.

##Evaluation

The command might make the files accessible but grants excessive permissions and ignores the actual cause.

Review:

ls -ld /var/www
ls -Z /var/www
ausearch -m AVC -ts recent

Potential appropriate resolution depends on whether the issue involves:

Unix permissions
Ownership
SELinux context
Web-server configuration
